WEBVTT

00:00:01.100 --> 00:00:10.300
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:00:11.110 --> 00:00:21.310
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:00:25.890 --> 00:00:30.790
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:32.290 --> 00:00:37.250
The sunset makes the vast
ocean a beautiful crimson shade.

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:39.300
A wonderful freefall.

00:00:39.630 --> 00:00:43.590
I just want the wind
to take me somewhere far away.

00:00:45.340 --> 00:00:48.470
I always cleared
impossible hurdles before...

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:52.680
...just by concentrating
because I didn't want to lose yet.

00:00:54.350 --> 00:01:00.350
But who's to blame when
it's not the best that I can achieve?

00:01:02.690 --> 00:01:09.030
Heading to the dream,
to the future with no end.

00:01:09.900 --> 00:01:16.030
Holding close a wish,
a wish you can't yield to anyone.

00:01:16.240 --> 00:01:21.500
Take the map in your heart,
the one that will not fade...

00:01:21.610 --> 00:01:24.670
...and hold it up to the light.

00:01:34.860 --> 00:01:37.480
O legendary Magic Knights!

00:01:38.560 --> 00:01:43.260
Hikaru Shidou,
Umi Ryuuzaki, and Fuu Hououji...

00:01:43.360 --> 00:01:47.160
The three were summoned by Princess
Emeraude to become Magic Knights...

00:01:47.270 --> 00:01:50.200
...and save another
world called Cephiro.

00:02:02.380 --> 00:02:04.610
Overcoming the attacks of Inouva...

00:02:04.720 --> 00:02:08.550
...who swears allegiance to Zagato,
Princess Emeraude's captor...

00:02:08.660 --> 00:02:11.450
...they acquired
Windam, Lord of the Skies.

00:02:11.560 --> 00:02:13.960
In search of
the remaining Rune-God...

00:02:14.230 --> 00:02:17.820
...Fuu and company continue
their treacherous journey.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:22.190
Because this world
is Cephiro, the land of will.

00:02:28.680 --> 00:02:34.620
A Powerful Foe!
Lafarga the Swordmaster

00:02:47.960 --> 00:02:49.050
Hurry...

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:51.960
Come quickly...

00:02:56.000 --> 00:02:58.940
O legendary Magic Knights!

00:03:00.840 --> 00:03:03.110
Before it is too late...

00:03:04.710 --> 00:03:05.940
Hurry...

00:03:11.250 --> 00:03:13.190
Are you in pain?

00:03:20.090 --> 00:03:21.690
Please stop...

00:03:22.360 --> 00:03:24.630
Stop this, Zagato...

00:03:25.970 --> 00:03:28.060
At this rate, Cephiro...

00:03:29.170 --> 00:03:31.930
This world will really fall to ruin!

00:03:33.580 --> 00:03:36.100
My heart does not change.

00:03:37.380 --> 00:03:39.780
Even if Cephiro
crumbles to nothing...

00:03:39.880 --> 00:03:42.650
Even if everyone on this land dies...

00:03:42.820 --> 00:03:44.010
My heart...

00:03:45.120 --> 00:03:46.550
...will not change.

00:03:52.330 --> 00:03:53.320
Emeraude.

00:03:55.130 --> 00:03:56.220
Zagato.

00:04:06.240 --> 00:04:07.640
Sea God Selece.

00:04:07.740 --> 00:04:09.300
Wind God Windam.

00:04:09.610 --> 00:04:12.940
Those girls from another world
have awakened two Rune-Gods...

00:04:13.050 --> 00:04:14.910
...from their long slumber.

00:04:15.020 --> 00:04:16.570
Only one remains.

00:04:16.680 --> 00:04:20.050
Only the scarlet Rune-God
that lies in the Fire Shrine.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:26.950
You are...

00:04:27.130 --> 00:04:28.430
Lafarga!

00:04:28.700 --> 00:04:29.660
Yes.

00:04:30.030 --> 00:04:34.400
Lafarga was the captain
of the guard that protected you.

00:04:35.240 --> 00:04:40.300
Of course, here in Cephiro,
the world supported by you, the Pillar...

00:04:40.410 --> 00:04:42.430
...he never had to fight.

00:04:43.540 --> 00:04:49.680
The guard was created to combat
the occasional monster that appeared.

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:55.590
Lafarga was known as the strongest
swordmaster here in Cephiro.

00:04:55.590 --> 00:04:59.720
Do you think that those girls you
summoned to become Magic Knights...

00:04:59.830 --> 00:05:01.760
...can win against him?

00:05:02.130 --> 00:05:04.260
Stop, Lafarga! Stop!

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:07.230
Emeraude, it is useless.

00:05:08.170 --> 00:05:11.940
I have put a spell
on Lafarga that controls his heart.

00:05:15.710 --> 00:05:18.370
W-What a cruel thing...

00:05:19.110 --> 00:05:21.380
Lafarga, please wake up!

00:05:21.480 --> 00:05:22.640
Lafarga!

00:05:26.050 --> 00:05:27.540
Go, Lafarga.

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:31.560
This time, return with
the corpses of the Magic Knights.

00:05:35.730 --> 00:05:37.720
Don't do it, Lafarga!

00:05:38.430 --> 00:05:40.030
Lafarga!

00:05:52.750 --> 00:05:54.840
Mokona, it's this way?

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:07.390
We are heading
toward higher elevation.

00:06:07.730 --> 00:06:09.820
The air is getting thinner.

00:06:11.430 --> 00:06:13.130
Umi! Fuu!

00:06:13.230 --> 00:06:15.230
Let's give it a little more!

00:06:15.340 --> 00:06:17.300
You still have energy left?

00:06:17.410 --> 00:06:19.770
You are not tired, Ms. Hikaru?

00:06:20.880 --> 00:06:26.180
It is a little tough for me, but both
of you were able to get Rune-Gods.

00:06:26.580 --> 00:06:28.550
So it's my turn now.

00:06:28.650 --> 00:06:32.420
I have to do my best
so I can revive a Rune-God too!

00:06:32.820 --> 00:06:34.750
Remember what Ferio said?

00:06:34.860 --> 00:06:37.190
There are three Rune-Gods in all.

00:06:37.560 --> 00:06:38.750
Three?

00:06:38.860 --> 00:06:39.880
Oh, yeah.

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:42.990
That means that each of us gets one.

00:06:43.100 --> 00:06:48.030
And so the third Rune-God
must be Ms. Hikaru's!

00:06:48.470 --> 00:06:50.700
Yeah, I'm sure of it.

00:06:50.810 --> 00:06:55.740
That's why Princess Emeraude
summoned three of us to Cephiro.

00:06:55.840 --> 00:07:00.610
So if we get that Rune-God,
we'll become Magic Knights.

00:07:01.180 --> 00:07:04.810
We must do our best
as Ms. Hikaru says.

00:07:05.150 --> 00:07:06.310
Yeah, let's go!

00:07:06.420 --> 00:07:07.390
Right!

00:07:13.260 --> 00:07:14.850
What's wrong, Mokona?

00:07:22.340 --> 00:07:23.300
A monster.

00:07:23.400 --> 00:07:26.170
H-Hey, is it eating something?

00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:32.200
It is eating an animal.

00:07:33.310 --> 00:07:33.750
Y-You're right...

00:07:36.450 --> 00:07:39.910
It seems the monster
believes us to be delicacies.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:01.540
Ms. Hikaru!

00:08:01.540 --> 00:08:02.740
Ms. Hikaru!
Hikaru!

00:08:04.680 --> 00:08:06.270
M-My eyes...

00:08:12.150 --> 00:08:13.590
Look out, Hikaru!

00:08:22.730 --> 00:08:26.390
What a creepy creature!
This is the end for you!

00:08:26.500 --> 00:08:28.830
Umi, don't drop your guard!

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:40.920
Ms. Umi!

00:08:40.920 --> 00:08:42.210
Ms. Umi!
Umi!

00:08:51.960 --> 00:08:52.930
Umi!

00:08:54.060 --> 00:08:55.290
Flame...

00:08:55.630 --> 00:08:57.770
It will be lethal if it hits Ms. Umi!

00:08:57.770 --> 00:08:58.890
It will be lethal if it hits Ms. Umi!
But...

00:09:00.770 --> 00:09:03.200
We must take that to Ms. Umi!

00:09:11.580 --> 00:09:12.950
Oh, the sword...

00:09:12.950 --> 00:09:14.510
Oh, the sword...
What's going on?

00:09:15.050 --> 00:09:16.810
I have no choice...

00:09:19.690 --> 00:09:21.450
Ms. Umi! Take this!

00:09:25.130 --> 00:09:26.350
It's heavy!

00:09:32.400 --> 00:09:34.830
Umi!

00:09:59.090 --> 00:09:59.920
Umi!

00:09:59.990 --> 00:10:01.390
Are you all right?

00:10:01.500 --> 00:10:02.590
Barely.

00:10:05.700 --> 00:10:08.260
Fuu, isn't that sword heavy?

00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:11.270
No, it is as light as a feather.

00:10:11.370 --> 00:10:13.770
Can I borrow it for a second?

00:10:13.870 --> 00:10:14.700
Here.

00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:15.940
It's heavy!

00:10:18.380 --> 00:10:20.210
That is strange. Why?

00:10:20.310 --> 00:10:22.080
This sword really is light.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:24.850
What? It was really heavy!

00:10:26.150 --> 00:10:27.550
Speaking of which...

00:10:30.930 --> 00:10:32.190
My sword...

00:10:36.330 --> 00:10:38.590
There is no change to it.

00:10:39.030 --> 00:10:40.640
So that's it after all.

00:10:40.640 --> 00:10:41.860
So that's it after all.
After all?

00:10:41.970 --> 00:10:46.240
Just before, when Fuu grabbed
this sword, it turned into water.

00:10:46.610 --> 00:10:47.730
What?

00:10:48.240 --> 00:10:52.340
In other words, these are
weapons made specifically for us.

00:10:53.050 --> 00:10:55.680
Weapons made specifically for us...

00:10:55.780 --> 00:11:00.720
And they've been drastically changing
shape since we got them from Presea.

00:11:59.610 --> 00:12:01.710
The armor has evolved!

00:12:02.850 --> 00:12:04.280
The swords too.

00:12:04.820 --> 00:12:07.010
The swords evolved too!

00:12:10.360 --> 00:12:12.950
All three of us have matching outfits!

00:12:14.730 --> 00:12:19.220
We have to do our best, especially
for Presea, who gave her life...

00:12:19.330 --> 00:12:21.270
...to make these weapons!

00:12:21.600 --> 00:12:22.860
Right.

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:29.480
But anyway, who defeated
that monster just now?

00:12:29.840 --> 00:12:32.440
Yeah, we have to thank him.

00:12:46.890 --> 00:12:48.830
That man over there...

00:12:52.130 --> 00:12:56.300
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:13:01.780 --> 00:13:04.300
Thank you for saving Umi.

00:13:07.820 --> 00:13:09.440
I wonder what's wrong...

00:13:09.550 --> 00:13:11.680
Perhaps he is just reticent.

00:13:11.790 --> 00:13:13.380
But isn't it strange?

00:13:13.490 --> 00:13:16.580
Thank you for saving
me from danger earlier.

00:13:29.170 --> 00:13:30.190
Umi!

00:13:38.180 --> 00:13:39.770
Ms. Hikaru!

00:13:51.890 --> 00:13:53.330
Who are you?

00:13:56.460 --> 00:13:58.330
Swordmaster Lafarga.

00:13:58.870 --> 00:14:00.230
Swordmaster?

00:14:00.330 --> 00:14:03.100
A warrior that defeats
foes with only his sword.

00:14:03.200 --> 00:14:05.040
Are you allies with Zagato?

00:14:05.140 --> 00:14:06.800
Why are you attacking us?

00:14:06.910 --> 00:14:10.600
My mission is
the annihilation of the Magic Knights.

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:14.580
Then why'd you save me when
I was attacked by that monster?

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:19.180
If a monster killed you, I would not
be able to accomplish my mission.

00:14:19.290 --> 00:14:21.380
Wait, what kind of logic is...

00:14:27.830 --> 00:14:29.520
Look at the ground!

00:14:29.630 --> 00:14:32.660
He did not touch it,
yet it crumbled away!

00:14:33.130 --> 00:14:36.900
Wind pressure. Wind pressure
from his sword swings is cutting it!

00:14:47.780 --> 00:14:50.750
I-It's useless...
I can't find any openings.

00:14:56.660 --> 00:14:57.850
Umi! Fuu!

00:15:09.900 --> 00:15:10.870
Look out!

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:27.210
My mission is
the annihilation of the Magic Knights.

00:15:28.260 --> 00:15:32.060
Not good...
If I evade this attack, it'll hit them.

00:15:36.660 --> 00:15:37.890
This is nothing!

00:15:38.000 --> 00:15:39.300
Run, Hikaru!

00:15:39.400 --> 00:15:41.160
You can't, Ms. Hikaru!

00:15:57.550 --> 00:15:59.140
I won't lose!

00:16:00.350 --> 00:16:03.620
Umi and Fuu... The three of us...

00:16:04.990 --> 00:16:07.590
...are gonna become
Magic Knights together!

00:16:09.430 --> 00:16:10.800
And we're gonna...

00:16:11.400 --> 00:16:13.030
...go back to Tokyo!

00:16:16.840 --> 00:16:18.100
Ms. Hikaru!

00:16:18.970 --> 00:16:20.460
Hikaru, use magic!

00:16:21.480 --> 00:16:25.040
The opponent's a swordsman!
I won't use magic either!

00:16:25.150 --> 00:16:28.710
I'll make sure I become a Magic
Knight along with my partners...

00:16:29.120 --> 00:16:31.210
...and save Princess Emeraude!

00:16:32.190 --> 00:16:33.250
Princess Emeraude...

00:16:33.250 --> 00:16:33.950
Princess Emeraude...
A-And Cephiro too...

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:35.550
A-And Cephiro too...

00:16:35.620 --> 00:16:36.880
The princess?

00:16:41.630 --> 00:16:43.650
W-W-What's going on?

00:16:57.380 --> 00:16:58.810
W-What's wrong?

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:01.710
What happened
to Princess Emeraude?

00:17:01.820 --> 00:17:03.250
P-Princess...

00:17:04.020 --> 00:17:06.280
Lafarga! Lafarga!

00:17:08.190 --> 00:17:10.050
Princess Emeraude!

00:17:40.820 --> 00:17:43.050
Princess Emeraude!

00:18:15.460 --> 00:18:17.750
Princess Emeraude!

00:18:23.800 --> 00:18:25.890
Guard Captain Lafarga...

00:18:26.300 --> 00:18:29.630
...I will acknowledge that
you are faithful to your master.

00:18:31.140 --> 00:18:35.340
Zagato, for what reason are
you taking Princess Emeraude?

00:18:35.440 --> 00:18:37.270
Where will you take her?

00:18:37.740 --> 00:18:41.240
That information
has nothing to do with you.

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:05.900
Lafarga!

00:19:07.040 --> 00:19:08.010
Lafarga!

00:19:08.110 --> 00:19:09.370
Lafarga!

00:19:21.050 --> 00:19:25.320
A weapon just for me...
It turned into flames just now.

00:19:26.060 --> 00:19:27.920
H-Hikaru's sword...

00:19:28.030 --> 00:19:31.620
...emits flames when held by
someone other than its owner.

00:19:36.900 --> 00:19:38.670
W-Where am I?

00:19:41.480 --> 00:19:44.340
The princess...
Where is Princess Emeraude?

00:19:48.980 --> 00:19:51.380
I must save Princess Emeraude...

00:19:51.920 --> 00:19:55.580
Save the princess?
You aren't one of Zagato's allies?

00:19:56.620 --> 00:20:01.320
I serve Princess Emeraude,
the Pillar of Cephiro.

00:20:02.030 --> 00:20:06.520
I am supposed to help so that
nothing interferes with her prayers...

00:20:06.630 --> 00:20:08.930
...that preserve peace on this land.

00:20:09.040 --> 00:20:14.740
I tried to stop High Priest Zagato,
who was trying to abduct her, and...

00:20:16.280 --> 00:20:18.940
How did you get
your wounds? Could it be...

00:20:19.710 --> 00:20:23.770
It's all right. You were
probably controlled by Zagato.

00:20:23.880 --> 00:20:25.650
So it's all right.

00:20:27.150 --> 00:20:28.710
Hey, hold on!

00:20:28.820 --> 00:20:33.160
If you're not one of Zagato's allies,
could you help us out of here?

00:20:38.870 --> 00:20:39.920
Lafarga.

00:20:40.270 --> 00:20:41.200
Here.

00:20:44.940 --> 00:20:46.460
My apologies.

00:20:47.010 --> 00:20:50.570
Wasn't that fire hot?
Are you all right?

00:20:54.080 --> 00:20:55.050
I'm fine.

00:20:57.520 --> 00:20:58.950
Who are you?

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:02.420
We were summoned
by Princess Emeraude.

00:21:03.320 --> 00:21:04.950
To become Magic Knights.

00:21:05.790 --> 00:21:07.120
Magic Knights?

00:21:07.230 --> 00:21:10.200
The legendary
Magic Knights? You girls?

00:21:10.300 --> 00:21:11.920
We aren't yet.

00:21:12.330 --> 00:21:13.320
Just a bit more.

00:21:13.870 --> 00:21:18.770
If we can revive one more Rune-God,
we can rescue Princess Emeraude.

00:21:19.970 --> 00:21:22.740
I see. You girls are...

00:21:23.440 --> 00:21:24.930
What will you do now?

00:21:25.650 --> 00:21:29.010
Only those from another world
can become Magic Knights.

00:21:29.120 --> 00:21:33.450
However, I will fight on in hopes
of rescuing Princess Emeraude.

00:21:34.390 --> 00:21:36.520
I thank you, Magic Knights.

00:21:36.620 --> 00:21:40.390
Thanks to you, I have been
freed from Zagato's spell.

00:21:40.890 --> 00:21:42.990
I hope to see you again.

00:21:45.130 --> 00:21:46.060
Lafarga.

00:21:46.170 --> 00:21:47.170
Mr. Lafarga!

00:21:47.170 --> 00:21:48.630
Mr. Lafarga!
Lafarga!

00:21:48.740 --> 00:21:50.030
He's gone...

00:21:51.100 --> 00:21:54.160
Umi, Fuu, we should go too.

00:21:54.270 --> 00:21:55.900
The third Rune-God is waiting!

00:21:56.580 --> 00:21:57.600
Right.

00:22:00.650 --> 00:22:02.770
We're gonna save
Princess Emeraude!

00:22:26.410 --> 00:22:30.810
Put the best smile
you can on your face...

00:22:32.380 --> 00:22:37.980
...and push down on that
pedal as hard as you can.

00:22:39.420 --> 00:22:44.980
Even if a really
strong wind blows against you...

00:22:45.730 --> 00:22:49.560
...don't give up hope so easily.

00:22:51.870 --> 00:22:55.030
Head for the big blue sea
that whispers in your ear...

00:22:55.240 --> 00:22:57.670
...what you really
need to know right now.

00:22:58.770 --> 00:23:02.570
Power that lets you
win over your tears.

00:23:03.610 --> 00:23:10.240
Now do the best that you can!
Your eyes will be someday soon...

00:23:10.980 --> 00:23:16.250
...basking in warm sunlight
and will start to shimmer.

00:23:16.620 --> 00:23:23.430
Just keep believing yourself
and never, ever give up...

00:23:23.930 --> 00:23:29.370
Your faith becomes
courage to live one more day.

00:23:44.790 --> 00:23:46.620
I'm Umi Ryuuzaki!

00:23:46.720 --> 00:23:48.710
This other world of Cephiro...

00:23:48.820 --> 00:23:52.550
...is now full of natural disasters and
about to crumble! We have to hurry!

00:23:52.660 --> 00:23:55.960
We're going to find the last
Rune-God and save Cephiro!

00:23:56.060 --> 00:24:00.400
Meanwhile, Inouva made
a certain decision for Zagato's sake...

00:24:00.500 --> 00:24:03.060
...and headed out to defeat us.

00:24:03.670 --> 00:24:05.370
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:05.470 --> 00:24:07.940
The Truth About Inouva
and the Return of Memories.

00:24:08.040 --> 00:24:08.610
The Truth About Inouva
and the Return of Memories

00:24:08.610 --> 00:24:10.580
The Truth About Inouva
and the Return of Memories
You have to watch it!

00:24:10.580 --> 00:24:12.010
The Truth About Inouva
and the Return of Memories

00:24:12.010 --> 00:24:18.940
Who is it today?

00:24:19.990 --> 00:24:21.920
Today, it's Mokona!

00:24:22.020 --> 00:24:26.980
Look forward to the next episode!
